# Keeps deployment uploads lean. NOTE: .vercelignore uses gitignore semantics —
# a bare directory name matches at ANY depth, so root-only excludes must be
# anchored with a leading slash. apps/api/assets (OG fonts + paintings) must
# ship: an unanchored `assets` here once stripped it and broke every request.
.git
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/dist
node_modules
**/node_modules
.playwright-mcp
.agents
.vscode
/assets
/launch-video
/docs
/*.md
.env*
